  "note": "Teacher in the 30M skeleton/joint protocol on a mixed corpus. Half the rows are executed equations of the forecasting generator (Shao-Wu, Jacobian, Heaps; all six channels of each sampled system), so every node position up to max_nodes and the treated parameter values are seen in training. The other half are combinatorial trees with an operator count uniform over 1-6, half of them with tanh protection. Test metrics are reported per treatment. Epoch selection uses validation rows drawn uniformly over the whole mixed validation split (validation_sampling), not only generator equations."
